{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_101_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ba271166c7e26baeb2e432a61f331ece38cc6c579922c566d32615fbfa9dc19a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_101_22:5_01_101_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:929a6151b3dddbb91708a685a17fe00a9cc3c9d76bd43fb358047f2ba5bbd317",
      "text": "诶，这个……\n是给我的情人节巧克力吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_101_22:5_01_101_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ec3f5c039f556b943a92121b703599c5572285b5af53613298f0c5c82002012",
      "text": "居然连我的那一份都特地准备了……！\n我真的好高兴。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_101_22:5_01_101_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e73f7e04938a824a21b2e9caca323739eec7f82e889f900ad64fa6ba6a4dc060",
      "text": "……真厉害啊。制作人的巧克力，\n光是收到就让人感到充满干劲了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_101_22:5_01_101_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8739e3d46a6b7e0505958c6da985cb6de35480dadcf82805d0d5ce15c41a8de3",
      "text": "现在感觉不管什么工作都能马上完成了！\n要是有什么我能帮上忙的，请尽管吩咐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_101_22:5_01_101_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00acd8195cf7a82ae3d46e6b0abb3b5fca68764eeae5fdaf07b3293ebd7a79a8",
      "text": "诶，现在没有吗？那我这就去泡茶。\n当然，制作人的还是老样子哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
